Hello All,

The 10x8, 12x8, 12x10 PE Swage Reducers will be made inactive for the time =
being.  These are part numbers 65-31151008,   65-31151208, 65-31151210 resp=
ectively.  When these are ordered advise the customer that we will be suppl=
ying them as the molded version.  These are part numbers 66-31151008,   66-=
31151208, 66-31151210 respectively The order documents should be changed ac=
cordingly.

We are doing this for several reasons:  We are developing our own swage red=
ucer so this inventory will next be replenished with product we made, the s=
upplier of the swage reducer has long lead times, and the molded reducer is=
 lower cost.

If shipping receives an order requiring shipment of a swag reducer in these=
 sizes they should call Customer Service to advise.  This shouldn=92t happe=
n if the part is made inactive.

John

--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA0EMAIL_
